  triage:title "Seven warn! sites in herdr_queue_wake.rs still lack subsystem/action/outcome structured fields (residual of AX5-QA1-014)" ;
  triage:description "AX.5 QA-2 (quality-mgr ax5-qa-r2, PR #1201 Final Quality Report 2026-09-05T14:22Z) at head fbee74ba8a9abf0b3e04b01bc157b8a65f194119. rust-service-hardening-agent and rust-qa-agent independently: of the 8 sites recorded in AX5-QA1-014 only one was fixed; at head fbee74ba8 the bare warn! sites are crates/atm-http-runtime/src/herdr_queue_wake.rs:174, :188, :203, :268, :619 (the Property-8-critical note_task_step_availability transition warn), :972 and :981. Fix: add subsystem=herdr_queue_wake, action=..., outcome=... to each, matching the five already-structured sites (:417, :431, :474, :508, :562)." ;
